        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >“chaos generates two principles, and the two principles generate four phenomena”</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>The Four </strong>is a 2D platform jumping puzzle game, set against the backdrop of ancient Chinese mythology. as a life of the Two principles world, player will seal <strong>The Four </strong>Mythical Creatures: LOONG,  BIRD, TIGER, and TORTOISNAKE—that have awakened once again, and explore the secrets of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes classic platform puzzles, and something new:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 elements: Wood (LOONG), Fire (BIRD), Metal (TIGER), and Water (TORTOISNAKE). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental skills: Elemental energy will bring different skills to the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental Planes: Influenced by <strong>The Four</strong>, the world has generated new dimensions—the elemental planes, and the road ahead lies within them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 element areas: Each area containing 4 scenes and a boss, each scene containing approximately 16 puzzles.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player will not die, but the road ahead is not easy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early access will open the Wood(LOONG) area, other secrets of the world are producing(BIRD, TIGER, TORTOISNAKE, ?).</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >“chaos generates two principles, and the two principles generate four phenomena”</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>The Four </strong>is a 2D platform jumping puzzle game, set against the backdrop of ancient Chinese mythology. as a life of the Two principles world, player will seal <strong>The Four </strong>Mythical Creatures: LOONG,  BIRD, TIGER, and TORTOISNAKE—that have awakened once again, and explore the secrets of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes classic platform puzzles, and something new:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 elements: Wood (LOONG), Fire (BIRD), Metal (TIGER), and Water (TORTOISNAKE). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental skills: Elemental energy will bring different skills to the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental Planes: Influenced by <strong>The Four</strong>, the world has generated new dimensions—the elemental planes, and the road ahead lies within them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 element areas: Each area containing 4 scenes and a boss, each scene containing approximately 16 puzzles.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player will not die, but the road ahead is not easy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early access will open the Wood(LOONG) area, other secrets of the world are producing(BIRD, TIGER, TORTOISNAKE, ?).</p>",
        "short_description": "The Four is a platform jumping puzzle game. More than 200 classic and innovative puzzles、thrilling boss fight and hidden secret in this game. [Early access: The Wood(LOONG) area is open. other secrets of the world are producing(BIRD, TIGER, TORTOISNAKE, ?)]",
